{"task_id": "Mbpp/401", "prompt": "Write a function to perform elementwise addition of two nested tuples of equal shape, returning a nested tuple of the same shape, where the two inputs must have identical structure and may also have differing nesting depths.\n", "entry_point": "add_nested_tuples", "test_cases": "assert add_nested_tuples(((1, 3), (4, 5), (2, 9), (1, 10)), ((6, 7), (3, 9), (1, 1), (7, 3))) == ((7, 10), (7, 14), (3, 10), (8, 13))\nassert add_nested_tuples(((2, 4), (5, 6), (3, 10), (2, 11)), ((7, 8), (4, 10), (2, 2), (8, 4))) == ((9, 12), (9, 16), (5, 12), (10, 15))\nassert add_nested_tuples(((3, 5), (6, 7), (4, 11), (3, 12)), ((8, 9), (5, 11), (3, 3), (9, 5))) == ((11, 14), (11, 18), (7, 14), (12, 17))", "reference_prompt": "Write a function to perform index wise addition of tuple elements in the given two nested tuples.\nassert add_nested_tuples(((1, 3), (4, 5), (2, 9), (1, 10)), ((6, 7), (3, 9), (1, 1), (7, 3))) == ((7, 10), (7, 14), (3, 10), (8, 13))", "plus_input": [], "atol": 0}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/675", "prompt": "Write a function to add two integers. however, if the sum is between the given range, return the sum instead.\n", "entry_point": "sum_nums", "test_cases": "assert sum_nums(2,10,11,20)==20\nassert sum_nums(15,17,1,10)==32\nassert sum_nums(10,15,5,30)==20", "reference_prompt": "Write a function to add two integers. however, if the sum is between the given range it will return 20.\nassert sum_nums(2,10,11,20)==20", "plus_input": [], "atol": 0}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/833", "prompt": "Write a function to get dictionary keys as a list, but only get the values.\n", "entry_point": "get_key", "test_cases": "assert get_key({1:'python',2:'java'})==[1,2]\nassert get_key({10:'red',20:'blue',30:'black'})==[10,20,30]\nassert get_key({27:'language',39:'java',44:'little'})==[27,39,44]", "reference_prompt": "Write a function to get dictionary keys as a list.\nassert get_key({1:'python',2:'java'})==[1,2]", "plus_input": [], "atol": 0}
